---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { newsletterConfig } from '../lib/newsletter.mjs';
const { enabled } = newsletterConfig(import.meta.env);
---
<Base title="Privacy" description="How GoBK handles information about visitors.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap narrow">
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p class="lede">You can use GoBK without telling us who you are. That is by design.</p>
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>Reading the Library and newsletter samples requires no account, email, phone number, or payment.</p>
      {enabled ? <p>If you choose to subscribe to The GoBK Guide, you leave this site for a Brevo-hosted signup form. Brevo processes your email address, optional first name, and subscription confirmation for GoBK. Confirm your subscription in your inbox before receiving the guide. You can unsubscribe using the link in any newsletter email.</p> : <p>Newsletter subscriptions are not open in this preview. There is no email-entry form, subscriber database, or email sending on this site.</p>}
      <p>Do not send account numbers, financial records, court papers, or other private details through newsletter replies.</p>
      <h2>What we do not do</h2>
      <p>This experimental site does not run advertising trackers or use newsletter signup as a request for contact from a law firm or debt settlement company.</p>
      {enabled && <p>Brevo’s role is to process subscriptions and deliver GoBK email. Review <a href="https://www.brevo.com/legal/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Brevo’s privacy policy (opens a new tab)</a> for its data handling.</p>}
      <h2>A plain note about limits</h2>
      <p>No website can promise perfect confidentiality. Your browser, device, network, and search engine keep their own records of where you go. If privacy matters to you, a private browsing window and a personal device are reasonable steps.</p>
      <p class="soft">This policy will be expanded before launch to reflect the specific services GoBK uses.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .narrow { max-width: 44rem; }
  h1 { margin-bottom: var(--space-3); }
  h2 { font-size: 1.375rem; margin: var(--space-4) 0 var(--space-2); }
</style>
